{"id":4725,"date":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","date_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/?page_id=4725"},"modified":"2026-06-04T17:27:39","modified_gmt":"2026-06-04T17:27:39","slug":"atlanta-wedding-dj","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/atlanta-wedding-dj\/","title":{"rendered":"Wedding Ceremony &#038; Receptions"},"content":{"rendered":"\r\n<p>We realize\u00a0your\u00a0wedding\u00a0&amp; reception\u00a0is the\u00a0most important day in two people&#8217;s lives, and the entertainment can make or break the reception.\u00a0 That&#8217;s why we do whatever it takes to ensure that the big day is a\u00a0complete success.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n<p>We start by discussing the vision you have for your wedding and wedding reception.\u00a0 Once you have reserved your date with us, we encourage a lot of communication in the months before\u00a0your event,\u00a0so that we can customize the wedding to\u00a0your vision.\u00a0 We start with emailing you a login and password to our\u00a0complimentary\u00a0&#8220;On-line Planning Forms&#8221; where you can do the following:<\/p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><strong>Music Requests<\/strong>\u00a0&#8211; You can add songs to your &#8220;Must Play&#8221;, &#8220;Play If Possible&#8221; &amp; &#8220;Do Not Play Lists\u2026 \u00a0You can even listen to clips of the songs through your <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/9-5e836b9e07692-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"398\" height=\"265\" \/>Itunes, and see the lyrics!\u00a0 If you are stuck on an idea for a certain event we even offer a Music Suggestion\u00a0tool on the forms that will give you ideas for first dances, party songs &amp; more!<\/li>\r\n<li><strong>Ceremony &amp; Reception Planning Forms<\/strong>: \u00a0Keep in mind we have over 15 years experience in the wedding field, our planning forms contain every possible ceremony\/reception tradition.\u00a0 You can check yes or no to each item and customize the song for each event.<\/li>\r\n<li><strong>Event Timeline<\/strong>: \u00a0You can give us a detailed (Or Rough Idea) of the timeline you envision for your event.<\/li>\r\n<li><strong>On-Line Payments<\/strong>: \u00a0To make the planning aspect more convenient, we even offer online payments.<\/li>\r\n<\/ol>\r\n<p>Once we have these planning forms completed, we will meet with you approximately 30 days before your event to go over all of these details with your assigned DJ.\u00a0 Your DJ will also act as the Emcee to make all announcements from start to finish, so you and your newlywed can sit back, relax, and enjoy the day, and not have to worry about small details.<br \/>All aspects of your event are considered including the setup, DJ attire, introductions, announcements, formal dances, and song choices, lighting colors etc.\u00a0 We are willing to help with anything to make your wedding exceptional.<\/p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n<p>On the wedding day, we arrive to do our complimentary set up at least an hour prior to our scheduled start time to make sure everything is ready.\u00a0You&#8217;ll see us coordinating with the other vendors so that the event continues to move along smoothly.\u00a0 Our DJs are professional, experienced, approachable, and completely open-minded.\u00a0\u00a0They have a knack for keeping the dance floor full while catering to the wide range of age groups.\u00a0 The volume is kept at just the right level and music requests are always welcome.\u00a0 Every performance is done with style and class, setting the stage for a magical evening that your guests will fondly remember.<br \/>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs wants to make sure that your wedding day goes amazing!\u00a0 Sometimes things come up, so we have a Wedding Emergency Supply Kit checklist for you.\u00a0 Feel free to download\u00a0and share! <a href=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/08\/Jammin-Emergency-Wedding-Supply-Checklist.pdf\" target=\"blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Jammin Emergency Wedding Supply Checklist<\/a><\/p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\r\n<p>JAMMIN&#8217; DJs is an award winning DJ company that specializes in exceptional and trusted event entertainment, d\u00e9cor &#8211; up lighting and photo booth services! We know the how important entertainment is for your special event, and we take every measure to make sure your event is a success! JAMMIN&#8217; DJs is the perfect choice for any event! We provide DJ Entertainment, D\u00e9cor\/Up-Lighting, Photo Booth Services, production lighting services, and atmospheric effects including Cold Sparks! <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theknot.com\/marketplace\/jammin-djs-littleton-co-555367\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"The-Knot-Ereviews\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/The-Knot-Ereviews.png\" alt=\"The-Knot-Ereviews\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" \/> <\/a> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/reviews\/jammin-djs-littleton-atlanta\/285ea0753099df68.html\" target=\"_self\" rel=\"noopener\"> <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"wedding-wire-rated-badge-768x768\" src=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/11\/wedding-wire-rated-badge-768x768-1.png\" alt=\"wedding-wire-rated-badge-768x768\" width=\"768\" height=\"768\" \/> <\/a> <iframe loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/J_5zwsWCTCA?rel=0\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"><\/iframe><\/p>\r\n<h3>DON&#8217;T TAKE OUR WORD FOR IT<\/h3>\r\n<h3>OUR SATISFIED COUPLES SAY IT ALL<\/h3>\r\n<h4>Check Out Reviews From Couples On The Knot<\/h4>\r\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We realize\u00a0your\u00a0wedding\u00a0&amp; reception\u00a0is the\u00a0most important day in two people&#8217;s lives, and the entertainment can make or break the reception.\u00a0 That&#8217;s why we do whatever it takes to ensure tha